{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41645","headline":"空城雀 · 陈陶","name":"空城雀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古城蒙蒙花覆水，昔日住人今住鬼。\n野雀荒台遗子孙，千年饮啄枯桑根。\n不随海燕栢梁去，应无玉环衔报恩。\n近村红栗香压枝，嗷嗷黄口诉朝饥。\n生来未见凤皇语，欲飞常怕蜘蛛丝。\n断肠四隅天四绝，清泉绿蒿无恐疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41645.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41645","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}